<title>INDIA: India produces 4,138 tonnes lead in December.</title>
<headline>India produces 4,138 tonnes lead in December.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 4,138 tonnes of lead in December 1996 against 4,346 tonnes in November, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 31,966 tonnes of lead during April-December 1996 compared to 31,636 tonnes in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed  December,1996    Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity   -------------    -----------------</p>
<p>	   (annual)    Actual	  Apr-Dec 96  Apr-Dec 95</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------  HZL     65,000	2,633	  19,697	 18,542</p>
<p> ILL Secondary</p>
<p>	   24,000	1,505	  12,269	 13,094</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------  Total   89,000	4,138	  31,966	 31,636</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in tonnes and provisional.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91 11 301 2024</p>
